  "label": "The man is mapped as the person who is about to start some shit today",
  "description": "The textual phrase 'i reckon imma start some shit today' explicitly identifies the man in the image as the subject who is about to initiate a disruptive or chaotic event. The visual material (the man) is thus mapped onto the textual entity (the speaker of the phrase) through the direct implication of the text. The man's serious, contemplative expression reinforces this mapping by visually embodying the 'determination' or 'foreboding' implied by the text. The bottom text 'mmmm hmmmmmmm' further solidifies this by suggesting the man is contemplating or committing to this action, making the mapping more complete.",
